#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: woocommerce-anti-fraud.php
msgid "WooCommerce Anti Fraud"
msgstr "مبارزه با تقلب ووکامرس"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: woocommerce-anti-fraud.php
msgid "https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-anti-fraud/"
msgstr "https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-anti-fraud/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: woocommerce-anti-fraud.php
msgid ""
"Advanced fraud and card attack protection for WooCommerce, with risk scoring, "
"rule-based controls, checkout protection, and tools to help merchants detect, "
"prevent, and respond to suspicious activity."
msgstr ""
"با استفاده از مجموعه ای از قوانین امتیازدهی پیشرفته، به هر یک از تراکنش های "
"خود امتیاز دهید، تقلب های احتمالی را بررسی کنید."

#. Author of the plugin
