msgstr "آدرس های ایمیل مسدود شده"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:835
msgid ""
"The email addresses listed in the text area will be considered unsafe. You "
"can also add or remove emails manually here. Type “,” or press TAB/ENTER "
"button for the next entry. Please add emails in bulk separating them by "
